                  "marks": [
                    "italic"
                  ],
                  "colour": "#268cff"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " find the probability of rolling ‘5’ once, twice, and thrice. Alternatively, you could consider the c",
                  "marks": [],
